</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">We are delighted to announce the upcoming <strong>Flywire Connect Delhi: Accelerating Innovation and Success in the Global Education Industry</strong> event, and we’d like to invite you to save the date for this exclusive gathering of industry leaders, innovators, and visionaries.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">This evening event will give you the opportunity to hear the latest insights, learn from others and network with peers in the education sector during a seated dinner.&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">As we continue to finalise the agenda and speaker lineup, we are eager to gauge the level of interest and ensure we accommodate all potential attendees. Therefore, we kindly request you to submit your interest in attending this prestigious event by clicking the link below:</span></p> </td> 
